      "side": 1,
      "message": "Still mentioning bb, but it might be right? If you query an internal builder and you require luci-auth for that, isn\u0027t there another more appropriate command to run? Because bb auth-login would actually work, I think, but it would be good if it doesn\u0027t get run because some build failure early, or logs got purged. But this might just be ok if bb auth-login is actually usable for this situation and is always available from depot-tools.",
